  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal fails to demonstrate that the property is located a reasonable walking distance from town centre facilities, in a place that can absorb the more intensive household occupancy and close to good public transport links (PTAL 4). The proposal is therefore unacceptable in principle, contrary to Local Plan Policy SC10. ",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal does not provide appropriate cycle storage facilities and inadequate access to the cycle parking provision, which would lead to an unsatisfactory development of the site and would fail to promote sustainable forms of transport contrary to Local Plan Policy EC2, London Plan Policy T5 and the West London Cycle Parking Guidance."
